@host = http://localhost:5169

### Valid conversion (200)
POST {{host}}/api/conversions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": 100, "fromUnit": "celsius", "toUnit": "fahrenheit" }

### Incompatible units (400, Conversion.IncompatibleUnits)
POST {{host}}/api/conversions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": 1, "fromUnit": "meter", "toUnit": "celsius" }
